# Release Notes Template

## Release: v1.0.1 (Quality & Development Process)

**Release Date:** June 11, 2026

### Highlights
- ✅ Automated changelog generation with Git-Cliff
- ✅ Comprehensive dependency auditing
- ✅ Quality assurance tooling standardization
- ✅ Enhanced git hooks and pre-commit automation
- ✅ Complete metadata and documentation structure

### What's New

#### Quality & Automation
- **Git-Cliff Integration:** Automated changelog generation from conventional commits
- **Dependency Audit:** `bun audit` integration in pre-commit hooks (non-blocking)
- **Quality Script:** `bun run quality` runs all quality checks at once
- **Enhanced Pre-commit:** TypeScript, linting, secret scanning, and audit all run automatically

#### Documentation
- **Metadata Documentation:** Complete project metadata in `docs/metadata.md`
- **Quality Checklist:** Comprehensive quality assurance checklist
- **Git-Cliff Guide:** Setup and usage instructions for changelog automation
- **CHANGELOG:** Detailed changelog with version history and contribution guidelines

### Installation & Upgrade

```bash
# Pull latest changes
git pull

# Install dependencies (if updated)
bun install

# Verify quality checks pass
bun run quality

# Start development
bun dev
```

### Key Files Updated
- `cliff.toml` — Git-Cliff configuration
- `package.json` — New scripts for audit and quality checks
- `.husky/pre-commit` — Enhanced hook with audit
- `CHANGELOG.md` — Comprehensive changelog
- `docs/metadata.md` — Project metadata
- `docs/quality-checklist.md` — Quality assurance guide
- `tasks/mvp-checklist.md` — Updated MVP status

